 ### Context-Translation Training with Segmentation Masking
-Passes a segmentation mask to the training process where pixels excluded in the stylization process are masked out [S4]. The loss is calculated only on the pixels outside the mask to avoid changing the appearance of masked pixels [S4]. It employs a background loss $L_{BG}$ as an additional regularization loss within the stylization process, defined as the L1 distance between the ground truth pixels of the background in the rendered image and the pixels in the background of the GT image, to prevent the model from introducing unwanted style artifacts in the background [S4].
